WEBVTT

00:07.380 --> 00:12.460
A girl in a labcoat gave me
the chocolate that turned me into a dog.

00:16.830 --> 00:19.290
She's gotta be at school somewhere.

00:20.210 --> 00:24.080
I have to find her and get her
to turn me back to normal!

00:25.080 --> 00:26.920
That means getting to school...

00:26.920 --> 00:29.130
by hiding in Inukai-san's bag!

00:36.880 --> 00:40.080
C'mon, now, Pochita!

00:45.420 --> 00:51.080
I know you want to come with me,
but you're not allowed at school!

00:51.080 --> 00:53.130
Dammit! You leave me no choice!

01:12.500 --> 01:15.290
You can beg all you want... but no!

01:18.210 --> 01:19.880
Worth a shot...

01:24.880 --> 01:27.830
Yosomi shinaide onrii wan na good boy

01:27.830 --> 01:31.000
Kimi to ireba wandafuru ranran raifu

01:31.000 --> 01:34.080
One, two, three de jump! Aijou atenshon

01:34.080 --> 01:37.170
Three, two, one de turn! Kitai ijou supaaku

01:37.170 --> 01:40.330
One to one de love! Gyakkyou furakushon

01:40.330 --> 01:43.420
Asa kara ban made wandafuru ni saabisu

01:43.420 --> 01:46.540
Daisuki datte tsutawatte little boy

01:46.540 --> 01:50.130
Aishite! Aishite! Aisasete I want you

01:50.670 --> 01:56.460
Boku o ikiro kanzen nenshou hashirinukero

01:56.460 --> 02:03.130
Gooru wa atarashii jibun sa
(Go Beyond Yourself!)

02:03.130 --> 02:08.920
Takaku hoero manshinsoui na kinou koete

02:08.920 --> 02:11.960
Ashita no (aijou atenshon)
bokura no (gyakkyou furakushon)

02:11.960 --> 02:16.170
Seiippai kagayaiteru

02:16.170 --> 02:17.670
This is your life, your way!

02:17.790 --> 02:19.330
This is my life, my way!

02:19.460 --> 02:20.330
Wan!

02:24.790 --> 02:27.000
<b>Off to School.</b>

02:26.130 --> 02:31.580
You absolutely, positively can't jump out, okay?!

02:33.210 --> 02:34.380
Morning!

02:34.380 --> 02:35.500
Mornin'.

02:35.830 --> 02:36.880
Sup!

02:36.880 --> 02:37.750
Yo.

02:38.250 --> 02:39.880
Morning!
Good morning!<b></b>

02:49.080 --> 02:51.330
Feels like forever since I've been here...

02:51.330 --> 02:53.540
Oh, how I've missed you, Sakihiro Gakuen!

02:55.170 --> 03:00.000
I gotta get out of this bag
and find that girl in the lab coat!

03:01.630 --> 03:04.580
From there, we integrate the equation...

03:04.580 --> 03:07.210
Class started a while ago...

03:08.580 --> 03:11.920
And this stuff's pretty tough,
so everyone's super focused.

03:12.330 --> 03:14.500
Now's the perfect time for me
to hatch my plan!

03:22.040 --> 03:25.330
Sh-she's gonna take notes
and stare at me, too?!

03:25.830 --> 03:29.670
Okay, who wants to do the next one?

03:30.960 --> 03:32.380
How about Inukai-san?

03:32.380 --> 03:34.420
Come on up for Question 5.

03:36.130 --> 03:38.420
Hello? Earth to Inukai-san?

03:38.420 --> 03:40.630
Yes, the teacher's calling on her!

03:41.000 --> 03:43.920
Could you come up to the board
and solve Question 5 for us?

03:43.920 --> 03:45.170
It's 2 times the square root of 3.

03:45.170 --> 03:46.670
That's some quick math!

03:46.670 --> 03:51.040
Huh? W-well, you're right, but I'd like you
to show your work on the board.

03:51.460 --> 03:52.790
2 times the square root of 3!

03:53.750 --> 03:57.380
O-okay, Tachibana-kun,
why don't you show us!

03:57.380 --> 04:00.460
Uhh, would if I could, teach!

04:03.880 --> 04:07.130
I missed my chance back there,
but I've got another...

04:13.290 --> 04:15.920
Wait, they're changing?!

04:21.920 --> 04:25.290
Guess they've got P.E. next...

04:26.000 --> 04:27.000
Damn!

04:27.000 --> 04:31.540
The girls in my class wear sexy underwear
under their boring uniforms?!

04:34.630 --> 04:36.920
Never imagined they were all down to get freaky…

04:36.920 --> 04:38.710
That's enough of that thought!

04:55.380 --> 04:58.630
C'mon, me! This is a total violation of privacy!

04:58.630 --> 05:02.000
They wouldn't want me spying on them!

05:02.000 --> 05:04.040
I don't want me spying on them!

05:07.580 --> 05:10.080
Are those the tights Inukai-san was wearing?

05:14.040 --> 05:15.330
They smell good...

05:15.330 --> 05:17.170
Ugh, really?!

05:17.170 --> 05:20.500
What is wrong with me?!
Stop being a creep!

05:22.960 --> 05:24.170
It's no use...

05:24.790 --> 05:28.210
No way I'm leaving this bag right now!

05:32.580 --> 05:34.250
They're playing volleyball today.

05:39.580 --> 05:42.040
Perfect, now's my chance...

05:43.960 --> 05:46.540
Wait, why's she coming over here?

05:50.710 --> 05:53.580
I ended up not getting
any chances during P.E....

05:54.250 --> 05:58.250
I've gotta take the next one,
else I'll be wasting time...

06:01.580 --> 06:04.790
Where are we now?
Back behind one of the buildings?

06:06.580 --> 06:08.080
That's her lunch.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.580
Guess it's about that time.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.040
Here, this is for you, Pochita.

06:15.790 --> 06:18.420
Inukai-san's feeding me!

06:21.460 --> 06:23.500
Don't get excited!

06:24.670 --> 06:27.750
She must always eat alone like this.

06:28.920 --> 06:32.580
I always assumed she went to go eat
with friends in another class,

06:33.080 --> 06:34.420
like Nekotani.

06:35.290 --> 06:38.380
But pretty much everyone here,
from students to teachers,

06:38.380 --> 06:40.170
avoids her like the plague.

06:40.460 --> 06:43.290
They all seem pretty scared of her.

06:44.000 --> 06:46.130
I mean, I was too, at first.

06:48.710 --> 06:51.130
You know something, Pochita?

06:52.750 --> 06:57.080
You're all I need to be happy.

07:00.330 --> 07:04.170
We're the only class who hasn't
decided what we're doing for the festival.

07:04.500 --> 07:06.880
So we're gonna fix that
by deciding that now!

07:07.250 --> 07:09.960
I thought we said we were
gonna do a maid café.

07:09.960 --> 07:11.880
Everyone does a maid café.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.540
The festival...

07:13.540 --> 07:15.000
Is it that time of year already?

07:15.500 --> 07:17.580
Anyone else have an idea?

07:19.380 --> 07:23.040
Inukai-san's ignoring homeroom
to focus on me instead.

07:23.750 --> 07:26.920
I'm gonna be stuck in this bag
all day, aren't I...

07:28.040 --> 07:29.460
Wait, that's her!

07:29.880 --> 07:31.040
Sorry, Inukai-san!

07:32.630 --> 07:35.960
If I lick her armpit, she'll raise her arm!

07:38.290 --> 07:39.330
Perfect!

07:43.210 --> 07:46.080
Inukai-san?! You have an idea to share?

07:47.670 --> 07:50.790
Sorry, Inukai-san, but I gotta go!

07:50.790 --> 07:52.290
Aww, a doggie!

07:52.630 --> 07:54.380
Wait, where?!

07:54.710 --> 07:56.880
What's a dog doing in here?

07:56.880 --> 07:59.000
Aww, he's so cute!

07:59.380 --> 08:01.580
Dammit, get outta my way, ladies!

08:03.420 --> 08:05.830
Shoot! The labcoat girl's heading out!

08:07.830 --> 08:10.420
Wait, that was totally intentional!

08:10.670 --> 08:12.500
All the more reason I gotta talk to her!

08:15.000 --> 08:17.500
How am I gonna get out of this one?

08:18.420 --> 08:20.830
I'll just have to use my special move!

08:21.540 --> 08:22.790
Through the legs!

08:24.630 --> 08:26.920
Yes! One down...

08:27.330 --> 08:29.330
another to go!

08:29.330 --> 08:30.580
Who's next?!

08:31.000 --> 08:32.080
Got you!

08:32.380 --> 08:33.580
Oh, no!

08:35.130 --> 08:37.250
You sure you're not hurting him?

08:37.630 --> 08:40.790
He's fine! I'm being gentle!

08:41.380 --> 08:43.670
What part of this is gentle?!

08:43.960 --> 08:46.630
At least Inukai-san has a softer touch!

08:48.380 --> 08:51.080
Dammit! Labcoat girl's gone!

08:52.000 --> 08:54.830
Not only did I break my promise
to not jump out of Inukai-san's bag,

08:54.830 --> 08:58.920
but she'll probably use this as reason
to never take me to school again!

08:59.250 --> 09:00.710
I have to do something!

09:01.330 --> 09:02.580
But what?!

09:03.080 --> 09:05.290
<b>School Festival Ideas</b>

09:03.080 --> 09:05.290
<b>Maid Café</b>

09:03.090 --> 09:05.290
<b>Haunted House</b>

09:03.090 --> 09:05.290
<b>Show a movie</b>

09:08.380 --> 09:14.750
Okay, I'll do something to make it so
Inukai-san has to take me to school again!

09:20.460 --> 09:22.420
He's so sweet!

09:22.880 --> 09:24.250
Cute!

09:24.500 --> 09:26.380
He's showing us his belly!

09:28.130 --> 09:30.170
Let's give him belly rubs!

09:30.460 --> 09:32.710
So soft!

09:33.000 --> 09:35.250
All these girls are touching me...

09:35.630 --> 09:38.380
Eat your heart out, human me!

09:40.580 --> 09:43.420
Whoa, this feels so nice...

09:45.500 --> 09:47.920
I love all these warm hands on me...

09:49.460 --> 09:51.630
Wait, hold up!

09:52.580 --> 09:54.920
You'll just let anybody do that to you?

09:55.790 --> 09:58.960
I thought we had something special.

10:01.540 --> 10:04.080
Shit, shit, shit!

10:04.460 --> 10:06.580
Inukai-san's losing it!

10:06.750 --> 10:10.790
C'mon, someone with a brain's gotta
pick up on what I'm trying to get at!

10:12.040 --> 10:16.830
Hey, why don't we do a dog café
for the school festival?

10:17.040 --> 10:19.330
Like, a dog version of a cat café.

10:19.330 --> 10:22.000
Yes! Finally, someone figured it out!

10:22.000 --> 10:24.380
I don't think anyone's done that before!

10:24.380 --> 10:26.250
I've got a dog that could help!

10:26.250 --> 10:27.580
Same!

10:27.790 --> 10:30.750
Do you think we could get
permission from the school?

10:30.750 --> 10:33.670
Sure, the school would probably allow it.

10:33.750 --> 10:36.040
Hell yeah, perfect!

10:36.040 --> 10:39.420
Now I'll get to come to school
during the festival!

10:39.830 --> 10:44.040
Hold on, though, whose dog is this?

10:44.540 --> 10:46.540
If he's a stray, I'm gonna take him h-

10:46.540 --> 10:47.380
Pochita!
If he's a stray, I'm gonna take him h-<b></b>

10:53.460 --> 10:54.670
Beg for mommy!

10:55.500 --> 10:56.380
Huh?

10:57.130 --> 10:58.790
What?!

11:03.000 --> 11:06.750
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:07.790 --> 11:10.380
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:10.380 --> 11:12.630
Let's go mai hausu!

11:12.790 --> 11:17.210
Airashii sono sugata ni sukitte sukitte tomaranai

11:17.210 --> 11:22.380
Watashi ga katte shiawase ni
suru kara kocchi oide yo

11:22.380 --> 11:26.500
Kyawakyawa chu chu chu himitsu no hitotoki wa

11:26.880 --> 11:31.540
Suki na mono ni massugu fureaeru daiji na jikan

11:31.920 --> 11:34.080
Shitawatteru kono kimochi

11:34.460 --> 11:36.460
Kakushiteta kono kimochi

11:37.000 --> 11:38.830
Mitsuketa kono kimochi

11:38.830 --> 11:40.500
Todoke! Todoke!

11:40.500 --> 11:42.500
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da daisuki!

11:42.500 --> 11:46.210
Kataomoi kimi ni kitto tsutawarimasu you ni

11:46.380 --> 11:50.580
Sono shigai kara miageta watashi ga itsuka

11:50.580 --> 11:53.130
Kimi no numbaa wan ni naritai

11:53.130 --> 11:56.000
Kokoro no soko kara I love you!
